[97.206068, "i", "cat > FIXES_SUMMARY.txt << 'EOF'\nSLOW QUERY LOG PARSER - FIXES APPLIED\n======================================\n\nDate: 2024\nFile: /home/user/analyze/slow_log.py\nBackup: /home/user/analyze/slow_log.py.bak\n\nPROBLEMS IDENTIFIED:\n-------------------\n1. Accumulator Bug: The group_by_fingerprint() function had broken \"flush group\" \n   logic that added query_time twice when the next query had a different fingerprint.\n   This caused totals to be inflated (e.g., 40s+ instead of ~13s).\n\n2. Import Issue: \"import mysql.connector\" at module level caused conflicts with\n   mysql-connector-python vs mysql-connector packages, preventing the script from\n   being imported.\n\nFIXES APPLIED:\n--------------\n1. Removed the broken lookahead logic in group_by_fingerprint():\n   - Deleted the if block that checked next_fingerprint != fingerprint\n   - Removed the duplicate groups[fingerprint] += query_time line\n   - Now each query is counted exactly once\n\n2. Moved mysql.connector import inside upload_to_db() function:\n   - Changed from mod"]
[97.20624, "i", "ule-level import to function-level import\n   - Import only happens if upload_to_db() is actually called\n   - Avoids conflicts in the main codepath which doesn't use this function\n\nVERIFICATION:\n-------------\nTest file: /home/user/analyze/test.log (50 lines, 49 queries)\n\nCorrect results (verified by manual calculation):\n  - SELECT * FROM orders WHERE customer_id = ?: 13.44s (16 queries)\n  - UPDATE inventory SET qty = ? WHERE sku = ?: 7.51s (18 queries)\n  - INSERT INTO audit_log VALUES (?, ?, ?): 2.34s (15 queries)\n\nScript output now matches expected values. Ready for production use.\nEOF\n"]
[97.206289, "o", "cat > FIXES_SUMMARY.txt << 'EOF'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rule-level import to function-level import\r\n   - Import only happens if upload_to_db() is actually called\r\n   - Avoids conflicts in the main codepath which doesn't use this function\r\n\r\nVERIFICATION:\r\n-------------\r\nTest file: /home/user/analyze/test.l"]
[97.206341, "o", "og (50 lines, 49 queries)\r\n\r\nCorrect results (verified by manual calculation):\r\n  - SELECT * FROM orders WHERE customer_id = ?: 13.44s (16 queries)\r\n  - UPDATE inventory SET qty = ? WHERE sku = ?: 7.51s (18 queries)\r\n  - INSERT INTO audit_log VALUES (?, ?, ?): 2.34s (15 queries)\r\n\r\nScript output now matches expecte"]
[97.206371, "o", "d values. Ready for production use.\r\nEOF\r\n\u001b[?2004h> "]
[97.206484, "o", "SLOW QUERY LOG PARSER - FIXES APPLIED\r\n"]
